			"notes": "## <=== Additions ===>\n- Torrium Ore\n- Mutalium Ore\n  - Includes Tools\n- Ender Pearl Ore\n- Blaze Powder Ore\n- Bubblegem Ore\n- Configuration Menu\n- Rich Mochite Ore variants\n- Compressed Minerals can be converted to their regular counterparts.\n- Lapis Geode\n\n\n## **<=== Changes ===>**\n- Complete overhaul of Ore Generation System. | #26\n- Depreciate 1.19.4\n- Rendfire Armor increases movement speed in Lava.\n- Aldus Armor increases Maximum Health.\n- Uranium Ore Texture\n- Rendfire Armor Texture\n- Animate Morkite Ore\n- A few Mochite Textures\n- Delayed Irradiate damage interval and separated it into two different effects.\n- Various generation tweaks to ores.\n\n## **<=== Performance/Cleanliness ===>**\n- When calling `offerSmelting` & `offerBlasting`, use newly created function `offerCompleteSmelting` instead.\n- Created `offerReversibleNuggetRecipe` function to simplify nugget-to-ingot and vice versa.\n- Almost entirely removed Encapsulation, as it is not necessary.\n- ~~Using 1.20's way of assigning items to a group.~~\n- Use Owolib's way of assigning items to a group ( with tabs )\n- Automate Model generation.\n- Automate Translation generation.\n- Use `blockStateModelGenerator.registerSimpleCubeAll` instead of `registerCubeAllModelTexturePool`\n- Use Owolib to inject tags.\n- Improve `BlockSet` API.\n- Collapsed various classes into one, and removed `Gemstyne` from some.\n- Bumped Loom & Fabric versions.\n\n\n## **<=== Fixes ===>**\n- Fixed Liquid Morkite flowing infinitely.\n- Fixed Bronze Nuggets not being craftable.\n- Fixed Bronze Rings not being craftable.\n- Fixed Bronze Nuggets not being able to craft Ingots.\n- Fixed RichOreBlockEntity not saving NBT data."
		},
