			"notes": "## <=== Additions ===>\n- Garnet Geode\n- Ikarite buds\n- Liquid Morkite\n\n\n## **<=== Changes ===>**\n- Complete overhaul of Ore Generation System. | #26 \n- Mochite experience gain decreased.\n- Uranium rarity indirectly increased.\n- Ikarite Geode rarity increased.\n\n## **<=== Performance/Cleanliness ===>**\n- Complete overhaul of Ore Generation System. | #26 \n- Majority of `List` instances converted to Guava's `ImmutableList` where applicable.\n- Several classes now delcared as `final`\n- Many variables declared as `final`\n\n## **<=== Fixes ===>**"
