			"notes": "## <=== Additions ===>\n- Fire Opal Ore\n- Crimonite Ore #5\n- Aldus Ore\n- Morkite Ore\n- Coal Ore now spawns in Compressed Granite\n- Rendfire & Aldus Armour | #17\n- Rendfire & Aldus Tools | #18\n- AfflictiveBlocks | #9\n- Decorative Blocks added for new ores.\n- Raw Blocks added for new ores. ( Still no natural generation. )\n\n\n## **<=== Changes ===>**\n- Red Maple Trees removed\n- Mochite Rarity increased\n- Morkite Rarity increased\n- General ore `strength` decreased.\n- *Most* distributions are now `trapezoid`\n- More blocks now have Blast Resistance\n- Uranium Rarity partially increased.\n- Uranium blocks no longer use Event Handlers\n- Uranium blocks now inflict custom effect.\n\n\n## **<=== Performance/Cleanliness ===>**\n- Ore Items moved to individual class.\n- Mineral, Ore, and Decor blocks moved to individual class.\n- English Translations moved to separate package and classes.\n- Far more classes and `Javadocs` to describe what everything does.\n- Depreciated `Lazy<T>` & `Codec` removed.\n- Methods created to handle various recipes' creation.\n- Partial conformity to Minecraft's way of creating certain blocks, etc.\n\n## **<=== Fixes ===>**\n- Ikarite Item model no longer 3D.\n- Ikarite Geodes no longer spawn above ground."
